# Fab / Marketplace packs are re-downloadable from the Fab library and must NOT
# go into Git LFS: Vehicle Variety Pack alone is 1.4 GB against a 1 GB free quota,
# and the code degrades gracefully without it (the FObjectFinders return null and
# every profile falls back to the previous SportsCar assembly). See ENVIRONMENT.md
# for how to re-fetch it.
/Content/VehicleVarietyPack/
